# Local experiment artifacts (do not commit)
# Checkpoints (265MB each), zarr stores, videos and thousands of per-task
# Slurm logs stay out. But `slurm_jobs/*.sbatch` / `*.sh` (the
# reproducibility record) and `outputs/plots/*.png` /
# `outputs/analysis/*.json` (the figures and result JSON) are tracked --
# the original repo ignored these two directories wholesale, which
# excluded exactly that. See CHANGES.md item 23.
data/
*.pt
*.zarr/
warp_cache/

slurm_jobs/*
!slurm_jobs/*.sbatch
!slurm_jobs/*.sh

outputs/*
!outputs/plots/
!outputs/analysis/
outputs/plots/*
outputs/analysis/*
!outputs/plots/*.png
!outputs/analysis/*.json
!outputs/analysis/*.md

*.mp4
